self-discipline is one of the biggest  things that will change your life  forever why because if you don't have  control over yourself you will forever  be a slave to your emotions your desires  and your passions people seem to have  less and less self control and you can  see the effect of it all over the world  to set yourself apart and start to think  different because if you can't master  your thoughts how are you going to  master your actions and your life  if you want to overcome most of the  challenges that this life throws at you  and achieve your goals you need to  change yourself first but how do you do  that one of the best things that will  help you to do it is self discipline  it's about controlling your impulses  your desires while staying focused on  what needs to be done to achieve your  goals it might be hard at times yes of  course nothing is easy in this world but  the results will be priceless  you alone are responsible for your life  no excuses all success in life doesn't  just happen  it starts with self-discipline and is  the ability to force yourself to do  something every day in spite of how you  feel until it becomes a habit  and the key to do that is to understand  the difference of what you want now  right now in your life how you feel and  what you want most out of life  and don't just wish for success but work  for it and what you're putting today is  what you will receive tomorrow because  you will reap what you sow to start  today discipline yourself by setting  clear goals and work for it every day  even if you don't feel like it  remember self-discipline starts with you  [Music]
 

